'''Cavalry Soldier''' (騎馬兵 ''Kiba-hei'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cavalry Soldier
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 215.png
|money drop = 150円 - 592円
}}

==Enemy==
A rather pathetic enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon Collaboration]] stages.  Low health, attack, pitiful range and overall weak stats to even be considered a threat.

==Strategy==
Using anything will make quick work of this enemy.

